⭐ Layer‑1a — CosmaChain Smart Contracts
Contract Engine • ABI • VM • Dispatcher • Domain Contracts • S3E2C3 • Identity‑Bound TX • L1 Core Bindings

1️⃣ CosmaChain Smart Contracts (Layer‑1a) provide the execution engine, ABI, VM, dispatcher, contract state, and domain‑specific contract modules for CosmaChain. This layer powers S3E2C3 behavioral scoring, identity‑bound transactions, revenue splits, benefits agreements, and app‑specific contracts (CosmaCare, CosmaStar, CosmaGigs, FilmCore, CaddiePro, CosmaSocial). It integrates directly with Layer‑1 Core and anchors commitments into Layer‑0 CosmaBed.

2️⃣ Purpose
Layer‑1a exists to:

⚙️ Provide a deterministic smart‑contract engine

📦 Define ABI + contract state + VM execution rules

🔀 Dispatch contract calls from Layer‑1 Core

🧩 Implement domain‑specific contracts for CosmaTech apps

🧮 Execute S3E2C3 scoring logic

🪪 Enforce identity‑bound transactions

💰 Execute revenue splits + benefits agreements

🔗 Bind L1 contracts to L2 protocols + L0 settlement

🧱 Serve as the contract execution layer for CosmaChain

This is the contract brain of the entire ecosystem.

