6️⃣ API Overview
📡 GraphQL API
Queries:

contractState(contractId)

contractEvents(contractId)

s3e2c3Score(account)

Mutations:

executeContract(contractId, input)

submitIdentityBoundTx(did, payload)

🌐 REST API
POST /contract/execute

GET /contract/state/:id

GET /contract/events/:id

POST /contract/identity-bound

