🔟 Summary: Historical Use & Uniqueness
Has this type of contract layer existed before?
Partially:

Ethereum has EVM + Solidity

Cosmos has CosmWasm

Solana has BPF contracts

But none combine:

identity‑bound transactions

S3E2C3 behavioral scoring

dual‑coin economic logic

app‑specific domain contracts

L1 ↔ L2 ↔ L0 anchoring

AI‑verified metadata

Why CosmaChain Smart Contracts are unique
They are the first contract system designed for:

real‑world service economies

identity‑bound execution

behavioral scoring

economic scoring

multi‑layer commitments

app‑specific contract modules

Advancement to Web3
CosmaChain Smart Contracts transform Web3 from:

“generic smart contracts” → “full ecosystem contract logic.”

They power:

identity

governance

scoring

tokenomics

oracle

tax

ledger

bridging

settlement

This is next‑generation contract architecture, built for real workers, creators, and service providers.
